{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Inspection Mechanics</strong>: Use tools like UV flashlights, thermometers, and manual scanners to uncover signs of infection or contraband in people and their belongings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525400/extras/screening_v2.gif?t=1747934037\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resource Management</strong>: Balance limited supplies of test kits and inspection tools while maintaining order and ensuring your checkpoint remains secure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525400/extras/qz_base_build_steam_1.gif?t=1747934037\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Threats</strong>: Face an evolving queue of refugees\u2014some healthy, some carrying ordinary illnesses, and others harboring deadly zombie pathogens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525400/extras/base_defense_new_animation_v2.gif?t=1747934037\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intense Decision-Making</strong>: Choose whether to admit, quarantine, or liquidate individuals based on visual clues, document verification, and medical tests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525400/extras/hard_choice_2.gif?t=1747934037\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic Progression</strong>: Manage daily routines, from morning base reports to nighttime defenses, as the stakes rise with each passing day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><strong>Better dead than sorry</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every survivor who crosses your checkpoint wants in\u2014but not all are free of infection. Use military-grade technology, sharp intuition, and strategic judgment to separate the healthy from the infected. Each mistake you make could mean disaster for the evacuation efforts you've been sent to oversee.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world\u2019s survival depends on your ability to hold the line. How long can you keep the outbreak at bay? Make a wise choice!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3525400?t=1747934037","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3525400?t=1747934037","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525400/071c42d1fd948210e4cd905f87cd249c8947499c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747934037","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525400/071c42d1fd948210e4cd905f87cd249c8947499c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747934037","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Inspection Mechanics</strong>: Use tools like UV flashlights, thermometers, and manual scanners to uncover signs of infection or contraband in people and their belongings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525400/extras/screening_v2.gif?t=1747934037\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resource Management</strong>: Balance limited supplies of test kits and inspection tools while maintaining order and ensuring your checkpoint remains secure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i